# Install Guide

## Windows Installer

1. Download `KCx Studio Companion-0.9.0-beta.1-win-x64.exe`.
2. Run the installer.
3. Choose the installation directory if prompted.
4. Launch KCx Studio Companion from Start Menu or desktop shortcut.

## Portable

1. Download the portable EXE from the release package.
2. Place it in a folder you control.
3. Run it directly.

Local workspace state is stored in Electron userData. Uninstalling does not delete app data by default.

